\ Model Knapsack_copy
\ LP format - for model browsing. Use MPS format to capture full model detail.
Maximize
 
Subject To
 Size: 21 x[item-0] + 11 x[item-1] + 15 x[item-2] + 15 x[item-3]
   + 34 x[item-4] + 25 x[item-5] + 41 x[item-6] + 80 x[item-7] <= 100
 Num: x[item-0] + x[item-1] + x[item-2] + x[item-3] + x[item-4] + x[item-5]
   + x[item-6] + x[item-7] >= 6
Bounds
Binaries
 x[item-0] x[item-1] x[item-2] x[item-3] x[item-4] x[item-5] x[item-6]
 x[item-7]
End
